														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4839927">
									

<p>You seriously need to expand on this. This is about as bare bones as it gets, and needs a lot. it's an intriguing idea, but:</p>
<p>1) A rescue mission won't be sent in if the MTF is killed.</p>
<p>2) Can outside observers watch what happens or is the painting unaffected as far as they are concerned?</p>
<p>3) This is more of D-Class thing than an MTF thing; most initial exploration is done by D-Class because they are expendable.</p>
<p>4) Is there a reason to explore more than a couple of paintings? While it would be interesting to explore some paintings, I'm not sure that this would be seen as more than a curiosity after a couple of trips.</p>
<p>5) Also, why was it created? Did the person have more than just exploration in mind, or did he want to see how the artist thought? An origin would be nice.</p>
<p>Again, an intriguing idea, but needs to be really expanded on.</p>

							</div>

								
					
