<p>1) You may want to write this up as an actual greenlight attempt; as some reviewers will are sticklers for the right format and will point out that this isn't the forum to elicit ideas.</p>
<p>Just write it up and see what it looks like.</p>
<p>2) SCP-J911 is probably not the best SCP to do as a joke. The Penis Taker is going to be seen as way too serious an SCP with too many side issues to be taken as a joke. Again, write it up and see what happens&#8230;.</p>
<p>3) Strictly as a side note, you may want to provide a link in the future to items you want to try in order to clarify which one you're discussing&#8230;..</p>

